          <span class="flex-none w-40 font-medium text-ink"><Lang zh="行业调研" en="Industry research" /></span>
          <span class="text-ink/60 leading-7"><Lang zh="用 AI 工作流在三天内完成一份完整行业调研（框架搭建 → 资料消化 → 成稿）" en="A complete industry study in three days with an AI workflow (framing → digestion → write-up)" /></span>
        </div>
        <div class="py-4 border-t border-ink/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline gap-1 md:gap-6">
          <span class="flex-none w-40 font-medium text-ink"><Lang zh="经营诊断" en="Business diagnosis" /></span>
          <span class="text-ink/60 leading-7"><Lang zh="为某苏州文旅集团完成经营诊断与运营方案（脱敏）" en="Diagnosis and operations plan for a Suzhou cultural tourism group (anonymized)" /></span>
        </div>
        <div class="py-4 border-t border-ink/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline gap-1 md:gap-6">
          <span class="flex-none w-40 font-medium text-ink"><Lang zh="商业策划" en="Business planning" /></span>
          <span class="text-ink/60 leading-7"><Lang zh="与 AI 协作完成「AI 店长」完整商业计划：洞察、产品设计、财务模型" en="Co-wrote a full business plan ('AI Store Manager'): insight, product design, financial model" /></span>
        </div>
        <div class="py-4 border-t border-ink/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline gap-1 md:gap-6">
          <span class="flex-none w-40 font-medium text-ink"><Lang zh="内容系统" en="Content systems" /></span>
