              zh="全面负责支付宝出行频道的用户增长策略、流量分发机制及商业化运营；同时作为核心负责人推进 AI 在运营团队内的组织能力升级。"
              en="Owned user growth, traffic distribution, and monetization for Alipay's travel channel; also led the AI capability upgrade of the operations team."
            />
