          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-ink/60">
            <li class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-dai-blue shrink-0">▸</span>
              <span><strong><Lang zh="AI组织能力升级" en="AI capability building" /></strong><Lang zh="：主导团队AI助手技能培训项目，2026年4月落地，推动团队AI化能力升级" en=": led the team's AI-assistant training program, shipped 2026.04" /></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-dai-blue shrink-0">▸</span>
              <span><strong><Lang zh="出行AI助手" en="Travel AI Assistant" /></strong><Lang zh="：主导产品设计，构建万级Query库，RLHF持续优化，问题解决率从30%提升至60%+；在AI回复中植入SKU推荐，探索商业闭环" en=": led product design; built a 10K-query library with RLHF loops, lifting resolution from 30% to 60%+; embedded SKU recommendations toward commercial closure" /></span>
