            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        {/* 美团 */}
        <div class="relative pl-6 border-l-2 border-ink/20">
          <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-ink/10 border-2 border-ink/30"></div>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-ink"><Lang zh="美团 · 酒店事业部" en="Meituan · Hotel Business Unit" /></h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink/50"><Lang zh="C端用户运营负责人 / 分销业务负责人 | 2019.09 — 2024.06 · 团队：7人" en="Head of C-end User Ops / Head of Distribution | 2019.09 — 2024.06 · Team of 7" /></p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-ink/80 text-sm leading-7 mb-3">
            <Lang
              zh="在美团酒店业务成熟期挖掘新增长曲线，覆盖用户增长、会员体系运营及分销渠道优化，提升间夜量、GMV与用户LTV。"
              en="Found new growth curves for a mature hotel business: user growth, membership operations, distribution optimization — lifting room-nights, GMV, and LTV."
