            <li class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-ink/40 shrink-0">▸</span>
              <span><strong><Lang zh="分销商业化" en="Distribution monetization" /></strong><Lang zh="：对接差旅平台、图商等外部B端渠道，协调产研完成API对接，优化商旅分销供给结构" en=": integrated B2B channels (corporate travel platforms, map providers) via API, optimizing business-travel supply" /></span>
