            <p class="text-sm text-ink/50"><Lang zh="产品总监 | 2017.08 — 2019.09 · 团队：30人" en="Product Director | 2017.08 — 2019.09 · Team of 30" /></p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-ink/80 text-sm leading-7 mb-3">
            <Lang
              zh="统筹两大品牌自营 app 平台的产品规划与运营，创新孵化国际化业务。"
              en="Ran product planning and operations for both brand apps; incubated the international business from zero."
            />
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-ink/60">
            <li class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-ink/40 shrink-0">▸</span>
              <span><strong><Lang zh="国际化从0到1" en="International 0→1" /></strong><Lang zh="：组建国际化团队，完成繁体中文、英语站点及微信小程序搭建，配套多语言客服与支付结算体系" en=": built the team and shipped TC/EN sites and WeChat mini-programs with multilingual support and payment settlement" /></span>
